[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the pipe from collar (1a) on the fuel filter and collar\n(1b) on the return manifold.</p><p>2. Remove the pipe from the engine compartment.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034126.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the pipe and connect the ends to the\nfuel filter and return manifold.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p>"]]